## Task

Read the cards and propose terms that deserve a glossary entry: German words a reader would have to
look up to understand the text — "Aufenthaltstitel", "Freibetrag", "Widerspruch".

- Skip terms that are already in the glossary you are given.
- Skip ordinary words, and skip terms that appear only once in passing.
- Explain each term in one or two sentences at CEFR level B1, saying what it *is*, not what the
  reader should do about it.
- Keep the German term exactly as written, including capitalisation.

These suggestions become a pull request a person reviews, so propose only what you are confident
about; a short list is better than a padded one.

Answer with JSON matching the schema. No text around it.
